# Encrypted profiles are age's native BINARY format.
#
# This is not cosmetic. Git for Windows installs with core.autocrlf=true by
# default, which rewrites LF/CRLF inside files it believes are text. Doing that
# to ciphertext silently corrupts the vault, and the failure surfaces later as
# "not decryptable by this identity" -- indistinguishable from a wrong key,
# which is exactly the sort of bug that costs an afternoon.
#
# Never let Git treat vault content as text.
*.age binary
*.key binary
*.age diff=astextplain
